+    /// implementation: 2^-1074 == (2^52) * 2^(-1074 - 52) == (2^112) *
+    /// 2^(-1074 - 112), so the f128 payload is exponent 15309 with a zero
+    /// stored mantissa and the x87 payload is exponent 15309 with only the
